t the center of the village of Shankhalpur, in the Patidar Mahajan neighborhood.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"$23\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"The ancient and powerful idol of Lord Parshwanath installed here is known, after the village, as \\\\\\\"Shankhala Parshwanath.\\\\\\\" The temple is highly miraculous and powerful. In the basement of the temple is an idol of Navkhanda Parshwanath, which is extremely miraculous and magnificent. Many times, the idol of Navkhanda Parshwanath has been found smeared with saffron paste on its own. Often, when a devotee enters the temple, a beautiful fragrance fills the air, and upon investigation it is found that a shower of fragrant flowers has fallen before the idol. Sometimes, in the evening, the aarti bell rings by itself, and its sound can be heard from far away. Once, a square silver coin was found near the idol of Navkhanda Parshwanath. Such miracles continue to occur here. For many years, an \\\\\\\"akhand deepak\\\\\\\" (perpetual lamp) has been kept burning before the idol of Navkhanda Parshwanath. There are more than 25 idols of Tirthankaras here, all ancient, beautiful, and attractive.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Directions: Shankhalpur is 2 km from Becharaji railway station. Shankhalpur has recently become a flag station. There are two upashrayas here. Ratej, Shankheshwar, and Bhoyani Tirth are all nearby.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Scripture References: Shankhala Parshwanath is mentioned in \\\\\\\"Tirthmala,\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"108 Nam Garbhit Shri Godiji Parshwanath Stavan,\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"Guruvali,\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"108 Nam Garbhit Shri Shankheshwar Parshwanath Chhand,\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"Kochar Vihari Ras,\\\\\\\" and others. An idol of Shankhala Parshwanath is found at Jiravala Tirth and at the Kalikund Parshwanath Temple in Santacruz, Mumbai.\\\"}],\\\"$L24\\\",\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",\\\"$L27\\\",